{"version":1,"content":"<p>剛於25日度過生日的「文青女神」袁澧林（Angela），由英國返港後即「交人」，與一眾演員好友胡子彤、黃溢濠、伍詠詩等食飯慶祝，她在社交網分享多張靚相向朋友致謝，手捧兩個蛋糕的她笑容燦爛，其中一個蛋糕更寫上「生日快樂喪小姐」，認真搞鬼！</p><p>她又</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:21:41.536031+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T13:18:21.935732+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:18:21.935732+00:00","content_hash":"4e9c852526877ac3abd94afb2dbe06bd18d8851c49435cb3bdb080721b4a7f1a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}